    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Payout</strong> is a shop simulation game where you build and manage your own shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide your customers with a smooth shopping experience by restocking shelves, hiring staff and managing your warehouse. Keep your shop clean and monitor changing product prices. Increase shop popularity to attract new customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/4e3fc537885f6117ee1cf8dea98f8b2f.poster.avif?t=1755462302\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/4e3fc537885f6117ee1cf8dea98f8b2f.webm?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/4e3fc537885f6117ee1cf8dea98f8b2f.mp4?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy complete freedom when designing, building and customizing your shop. You can change the layout, as well as the style of the walls, windows and doors. Add new decorations to get more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/5d361ba634cc6ed2e665551d517dd9c3.poster.avif?t=1755462302\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/5d361ba634cc6ed2e665551d517dd9c3.webm?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/5d361ba634cc6ed2e665551d517dd9c3.mp4?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive Around City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open city map as you drive around to restock your warehouse and buy new furniture and decorations for your shop. Deliver to customers' houses to complete their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/c8f93a1629950f4ffe9d3056731a9fd4.poster.avif?t=1755462302\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/c8f93a1629950f4ffe9d3056731a9fd4.webm?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/c8f93a1629950f4ffe9d3056731a9fd4.mp4?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Payout</strong> is a shop simulation game where you build and manage your own shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide your customers with a smooth shopping experience by restocking shelves, hiring staff and managing your warehouse. Keep your shop clean and monitor changing product prices. Increase shop popularity to attract new customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/4e3fc537885f6117ee1cf8dea98f8b2f.poster.avif?t=1755462302\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/4e3fc537885f6117ee1cf8dea98f8b2f.webm?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/4e3fc537885f6117ee1cf8dea98f8b2f.mp4?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Own Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy complete freedom when designing, building and customizing your shop. You can change the layout, as well as the style of the walls, windows and doors. Add new decorations to get more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/5d361ba634cc6ed2e665551d517dd9c3.poster.avif?t=1755462302\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/5d361ba634cc6ed2e665551d517dd9c3.webm?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/5d361ba634cc6ed2e665551d517dd9c3.mp4?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive Around City</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open city map as you drive around to restock your warehouse and buy new furniture and decorations for your shop. Deliver to customers' houses to complete their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/c8f93a1629950f4ffe9d3056731a9fd4.poster.avif?t=1755462302\" width=426 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/c8f93a1629950f4ffe9d3056731a9fd4.webm?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551680/extras/c8f93a1629950f4ffe9d3056731a9fd4.mp4?t=1755462302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
